<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila property stocks index falls 3.72 percent.</title>
<headline>Manila property stocks index falls 3.72 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine property stocks index dropped by 3.72 percent, or by 54.88 points, to 1,422.38 points in late Manila trade on fears of cashflow problems in the sector, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Rumours last week of financial difficulties faced by Megaworld and its unit Empire East affected market sentiment, despite a denial by the two companies, traders said.</p>
